[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 5.0,
    "text": "Everyone wants success. Everyone wants",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 3.35,
    "end": 5.0,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 3.36,
    "end": 8.515,
    "text": "to change their life.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 4.99,
    "end": 8.515,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 5.0,
    "end": 10.48,
    "text": "But most people fail not because success",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 8.505,
    "end": 10.48,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 8.515,
    "end": 13.1,
    "text": " is impossible,",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 10.47,
    "end": 13.1,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 10.48,
    "end": 14.92,
    "text": "but because they think big results need",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 13.09,
    "end": 14.92,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 13.1,
    "end": 17.32,
    "text": " big actions.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 14.91,
    "end": 17.32,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 14.92,
    "end": 20.88,
    "text": "They wait for the perfect moment, the",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 17.31,
    "end": 20.88,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 17.32,
    "end": 23.12,
    "text": "perfect plan, the perfect opportunity,",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 20.87,
    "end": 23.12,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 20.88,
    "end": 24.64,
    "text": "and while waiting their dreams slowly",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 23.11,
    "end": 24.64,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 23.12,
    "end": 27.24,
    "text": "fade away.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 24.63,
    "end": 27.24,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 24.64,
    "end": 29.76,
    "text": "But what if I told you that success is",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 27.23,
    "end": 29.76,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 27.24,
    "end": 33.24,
    "text": "not about giant leaps?",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 29.75,
    "end": 33.24,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 29.76,
    "end": 35.2,
    "text": "What if just 1% improvement every single",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 33.23,
    "end": 35.2,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 33.24,
    "end": 37.99,
    "text": "day  could completely transform",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 35.19,
    "end": 37.99,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 35.2,
    "end": 38.16,
    "text": "your life? My name is Ayan,",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 37.98,
    "end": 38.16,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 37.99,
    "end": 40.48,
    "text": " ",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 38.15,
    "end": 40.48,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 38.16,
    "end": 42.96,
    "text": " and today I want to share a story that",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 40.47,
    "end": 42.96,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 40.48,
    "end": 45.56,
    "text": "changed the way I think about growth,",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 42.95,
    "end": 45.56,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 42.96,
    "end": 49.6,
    "text": "effort, and becoming better.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 45.55,
    "end": 49.6,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 45.56,
    "end": 52.72,
    "text": "Meet Omar. Omar was an ordinary boy,",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 49.59,
    "end": 52.72,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 49.6,
    "end": 54.96,
    "text": "weak in studies, weak in sports, ",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 52.71,
    "end": 54.96,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 52.72,
    "end": 57.28,
    "text": "weak in almost everything.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 54.95,
    "end": 57.28,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 54.96,
    "end": 58.36,
    "text": "Every time he looked at others, he felt",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 57.27,
    "end": 58.36,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 57.28,
    "end": 60.76,
    "text": "small.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 58.35,
    "end": 60.76,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 58.36,
    "end": 63.52,
    "text": "His friends  scored higher, ran",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 60.75,
    "end": 63.52,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 60.76,
    "end": 65.199,
    "text": "faster, spoke better.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 63.51,
    "end": 65.199,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 63.52,
    "end": 68.2,
    "text": "He tried to change  himself so",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 65.189,
    "end": 68.2,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 65.199,
    "end": 71.4,
    "text": "many times, but the pressure of becoming",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 68.19,
    "end": 71.4,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 68.2,
    "end": 74.8,
    "text": "perfect overnight always broke him.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 71.39,
    "end": 74.8,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 71.4,
    "end": 77.29,
    "text": "He studied hard for 1 week, then quit.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 74.79,
    "end": 77.29,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 74.8,
    "end": 79.88,
    "text": "He joined the gym, then stopped after",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 77.28,
    "end": 79.88,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 77.29,
    "end": 82.68,
    "text": " 10 days. He tried waking up",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 79.87,
    "end": 82.68,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 79.88,
    "end": 84.44,
    "text": "early, but failed by day three.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 82.67,
    "end": 84.44,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 82.68,
    "end": 86.52,
    "text": "Every time he failed,  he told",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 84.43,
    "end": 86.52,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 84.44,
    "end": 89.36,
    "text": "himself the same thing.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 86.51,
    "end": 89.36,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 86.52,
    "end": 92.44,
    "text": "Maybe I'm just not made for this, and",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 89.35,
    "end": 92.44,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 89.36,
    "end": 94.68,
    "text": "slowly  he started believing it.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 92.43,
    "end": 94.68,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 92.44,
    "end": 97.56,
    "text": "One afternoon, Omar was sitting in the",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 94.67,
    "end": 97.56,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 94.68,
    "end": 100.04,
    "text": "courtyard feeling completely lost. His",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 97.55,
    "end": 100.04,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 97.56,
    "end": 102.12,
    "text": "grandfather was sitting nearby doing",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 100.03,
    "end": 102.12,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 100.04,
    "end": 104.92,
    "text": "something  with his hands.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 102.11,
    "end": 104.92,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 102.12,
    "end": 109.84,
    "text": "Omar looked closer. The old man was",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 104.91,
    "end": 109.84,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 104.92,
    "end": 112.28,
    "text": "making a rope, slowly, quietly, twisting",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 109.83,
    "end": 112.28,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 109.84,
    "end": 113.52,
    "text": "one thin thread at a time around ",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 112.27,
    "end": 113.52,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 112.28,
    "end": 116.24,
    "text": "another.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 113.51,
    "end": 116.24,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 113.52,
    "end": 118.44,
    "text": "Omar watched for a while, then said,",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 116.23,
    "end": 118.44,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 116.24,
    "end": 120.2,
    "text": "\"Grandfather, you have been sitting here",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 118.43,
    "end": 120.2,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 118.44,
    "end": 123.4,
    "text": "for an hour  and the rope is",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 120.19,
    "end": 123.4,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 120.2,
    "end": 126.12,
    "text": "still so short. What is the point?\"",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 123.39,
    "end": 126.12,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 123.4,
    "end": 127.84,
    "text": "His grandfather did not stop. He just",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 126.11,
    "end": 127.84,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 126.12,
    "end": 130.64,
    "text": "smiled and said,",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 127.83,
    "end": 130.64,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 127.84,
    "end": 132.966,
    "text": "\"Pick up one  of these threads.\"",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 130.63,
    "end": 132.966,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 130.64,
    "end": 135.52,
    "text": "Omar picked up a single thin thread",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 132.956,
    "end": 135.52,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 132.966,
    "end": 137.4,
    "text": " and pulled it from both ends.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 135.51,
    "end": 137.4,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 135.52,
    "end": 140.2,
    "text": "It snapped instantly.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 137.39,
    "end": 140.2,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 137.4,
    "end": 142.76,
    "text": "His grandfather nodded and said,",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 140.19,
    "end": 142.76,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 140.2,
    "end": 145.12,
    "text": "\"Now try to  break this rope.\"",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 142.75,
    "end": 145.12,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 142.76,
    "end": 146.76,
    "text": "Omar grabbed the rope with both hands",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 145.11,
    "end": 146.76,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 145.12,
    "end": 149.08,
    "text": "and pulled  hard.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 146.75,
    "end": 149.08,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 146.76,
    "end": 150.92,
    "text": "It did not break. It did not even",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 149.07,
    "end": 150.92,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 149.08,
    "end": 152.36,
    "text": "stretch much.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 150.91,
    "end": 152.36,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 150.92,
    "end": 155.24,
    "text": "His grandfather  looked at him",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 152.35,
    "end": 155.24,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 152.36,
    "end": 155.891,
    "text": "and said, \"Omar, one thread alone is",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 155.23,
    "end": 155.891,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 155.24,
    "end": 156.28,
    "text": "weak.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 155.881,
    "end": 156.28,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 155.891,
    "end": 158.8,
    "text": " ",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 156.27,
    "end": 158.8,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 156.28,
    "end": 161.72,
    "text": " It breaks with a single pull.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 158.79,
    "end": 161.72,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 158.8,
    "end": 163.16,
    "text": "But when you twist thread after thread,",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 161.71,
    "end": 163.16,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 161.72,
    "end": 165.68,
    "text": "day after day, ",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 163.15,
    "end": 165.68,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 163.16,
    "end": 167.84,
    "text": "slowly, patiently,",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 165.67,
    "end": 167.84,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 165.68,
    "end": 169.6,
    "text": "they stop being separate.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 167.83,
    "end": 169.6,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 167.84,
    "end": 171.84,
    "text": "They become one",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 169.59,
    "end": 171.84,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 169.6,
    "end": 173.56,
    "text": "and that one rope can hold more weight",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 171.83,
    "end": 173.56,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 171.84,
    "end": 175.68,
    "text": "than you can imagine.\"",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 173.55,
    "end": 175.68,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 173.56,
    "end": 177.68,
    "text": "He paused and  then said,",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 175.67,
    "end": 177.68,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 175.68,
    "end": 178.88,
    "text": "\"Your efforts are like these threads, my",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 177.67,
    "end": 178.88,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 177.68,
    "end": 181.959,
    "text": "child.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 178.87,
    "end": 181.959,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 178.88,
    "end": 185.12,
    "text": "One good habit feels weak.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 181.949,
    "end": 185.12,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 181.959,
    "end": 187.84,
    "text": "One small  action feels useless.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 185.11,
    "end": 187.84,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 185.12,
    "end": 190.44,
    "text": "But every day you add another thread,",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 187.83,
    "end": 190.44,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 187.84,
    "end": 193.48,
    "text": "another 15  minutes of study,",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 190.43,
    "end": 193.48,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 190.44,
    "end": 194.8,
    "text": "another small effort, another small step",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 193.47,
    "end": 194.8,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 193.48,
    "end": 197.76,
    "text": "forward.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 194.79,
    "end": 197.76,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 194.8,
    "end": 199.6,
    "text": "And one day, without even realizing it,",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 197.75,
    "end": 199.6,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 197.76,
    "end": 201.76,
    "text": "you have built  something that",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 199.59,
    "end": 201.76,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 199.6,
    "end": 204.4,
    "text": "cannot be broken.\"",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 201.75,
    "end": 204.4,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 201.76,
    "end": 207.36,
    "text": "Those words hit Omar deeply.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 204.39,
